#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:153
#: 728c08f6ab1f414caad2a68827a5c7ce
msgid ""
"传统：  test   →  implement  →  observe\n"
"AI：    specify → test       →  observe\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:158
#: 3536cbe9a3b049fb9dd48c7c5d1bba0e
msgid "人写代码：测试是第一份规约"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:159
#: f8dd0afa0f9c4ea5849826c19992a201
msgid "智能体写代码：**规约前置**，测试抓幻觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:161
#: 5252ce27394d4fb084f8bbe61dad73c8
msgid ""
"画完后停 5 秒不说话，让听众自己读出 *\"咦，SDD 顶到最前面去了\"*。 然后说 —— "
"*\"为什么翻转？因为人写的主要制品从代码移到了规约。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:166
#: 11e49187f8034672a0690ef0ea5ebdd7
msgid "Slide 12 —— §F.3 · 三护法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:168
#: 826f0c2802904b02bbe483115e4e4c03
msgid "**SDD** · Specification-Driven · 说 · 可理解"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:169
#: 3d076c92091e4f06a360909c16c4f484
msgid "**TDD** · Test-Driven · 证 · 可验证"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:170
#: e8e71b7d1f254421a6c024812f846b62
msgid "**MDD** · Metric-Driven · 观 · 可观测"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:172
#: 3d892d580d64475fb5947841991733a2
msgid ""
"三个单词 + 三个动词 + 三个形容词。**念完即走**。 一个要提防的误读：*\"我们已经有 CI 了啊。\"* —— 回一句： *\"CI 是"
" TDD/MDD 的牧场；harness 在键盘按下那一刻就发声。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:178
#: 00568c5b8adb4049b867ccab349e7888
msgid "Slide 13 —— §F.4 · 3 × 4 矩阵（全屏）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:180
#: 95b7458e33d34403a1f4675009e2aae8
msgid ""
"          Bridle    Fence      Paddock     Groom\n"
"          写前      写时        写后        维护\n"
"\n"
"SDD (说)  AGENTS    lint       gate        索引\n"
"TDD (证)  pre-edit  pre-commit CI          flaky 隔离\n"
"MDD (观)  北极星    成本上限    SLI         指标轮替\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:189
#: c4c6a322c31b4298ae40251e84e33b36
msgid ""
"**本场最重要的一张 slide**。不要用动画 —— 一上来就全显示。 讲稿停在这里 4 分钟：4 列各 30 秒 + 3 行各 30 秒 + "
"收尾 30 秒。 收尾那句：*\"这张表是剩下 30 分钟的地图。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:195
#: 715b407c295744e79ab33a6b091657e8
msgid "Slide 14 —— §F.4 · 四区域各一句"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:197
#: 06724209b7dd488cb4311ff00a76ac88
msgid "**Bridle（缰绳）** 敲第一个键之前 *看什么、听什么*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:198
#: d0390eaf900d4542b6cee714ae81a110
msgid "**Fence（护栏）** 不管作者是谁，*一律拒绝* 坏制品"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:199
#: 0776f1cdd04347d7b95544af03e949b1
msgid "**Paddock（牧场）** *可以撒欢的那块地* 的边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:200
#: 90d423e60643458db4825eaae56e90c5
msgid "**Groom（梳理）** 维护 *挽具本身* 的重复性工作"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:202
#: 9a39e15d0eb9452e861a808685d9fe37
msgid "如果 Slide 13 时间用完了，这张可以砍。否则 1 分钟讲完。 强调 Groom —— *\"没有 Groom 的挽具，是装饰。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:207
#: ea081b3a3d934a9896adab368a82cd31
msgid "Slide 15 —— §F.5 · 四个案例横轴"
msgstr ""

