#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:229
#: 91c4ae41a6ac45cb8345433aa880eab9
msgid ""
"每个 60 秒。重点是让听众 **识别** 自己项目最像哪个，不是评判哪个更好。 一句带走 —— "
"*\"矩阵是尺子，案例是刻度。挑最像你技术栈的那一个抄。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:234
#: e4f06a9a027f4d9c841d45e3f2ec57ed
msgid "Slide 17 —— §F.6 · Lazy AI Coder 四幕"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:236
#: 6fe276fb2a104c55bfd3e026a4fc8431
msgid ""
"Act 1    Act 2        Act 3       Act 4\n"
"审计     短板         修复         度量 delta\n"
"Audit    Short-       Fixes        Measure\n"
"         comings\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:243
#: 1b68866df8e6436987ab197d1031078e
msgid "本书对自己的仓库做了一次实盘"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:244
#: 7975e7a095a34476862c43c8bebbcae2
msgid "矩阵 → 审计 → 修复 → 重打分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:246
#: f9533c4156574e7da89c60fec3d55c9c
msgid "开场一句 —— *\"如果这套框架连书自己的宿主仓库都打不分、改不动， 那它就是错的。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:251
#: 05e524a445594119bfd7448760908b48
msgid "Slide 18 —— §F.6 · Act 4 的 delta"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:253
#: 38b56435861d4895a001f064c6a37361
msgid "SDD 均值 **1.75 → 3.00**（+1.25）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:254
#: 38bf1a57bfa84ac9aa6e1b82b6a8baa6
msgid "TDD 均值 **2.00 → 2.75**（+0.75）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:255
#: e0b9404981a04d87a1cf53650ae8d0a2
msgid "MDD 均值 **1.50 → 1.50**（+0.00）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:256
#: 6d06a7fa10a84ed5aad28503090f4408
msgid "**总分 1.75 → 2.42**（+0.67）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:258
#: b088a2afb17e4c3d8efaca2389eda7fc
msgid ""
"念 \"1.75\" 慢，念 \"3.00\" 快 —— 听众自己会算 delta。 提防 —— *\"HarnessCard ≠ "
"虚荣分数。只要你公开评分尺、证据指针、 delta，它就是分析工具不是虚荣。\"* 说明 —— *\"MDD 没动是故意的。90 天内先把 SDD"
" 做到及格才配谈 MDD。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:265
#: bf839aa548b74289a4c973a20dd4114f
msgid "Slide 19 —— §F.7 · 三个里程碑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:267
#: 4dcc3fc30b0a428787f0f953b203716e
msgid ""
"Day 1–30     Day 31–60        Day 61–90\n"
"一格         一行 或 一列      一次完整评审\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:272
#: 296246dd025440f2a76208f72894bf52
msgid "**不必一次做完 12 格**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:273
#: bcb7d56e10c1429d9c1ed321735726a5
msgid "挑一格 → 扩到行/列 → 公开打分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:275
#: f02e468490394cb7b9f37cd3d4a4567e
msgid ""
"画完后直接问 —— *\"如果我们部门只做 Day 30 这一步， 你会选 SDD × Bridle 还是 TDD × Fence？为什么？\"*"
" 这一问会让下一张 slide 的 Q&A 氛围自动热起来。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:281
#: db2c5726d6dc4adfa4792f8e60dd64fb
msgid "Slide 20 —— §F.7 · Day 30 三个推荐切入点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:283
#: 8f46cbf9185e46de9b5930d20ee0e102
msgid "**SDD × Bridle** —— 写一份 `AGENTS.md` （便宜，之后每一轮都赚）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:285
#: edea461943bd4a1280c2264ead267f61
msgid "**TDD × Fence** —— 装一条 `PreToolUse` 钩子 （测试红时拒写；单兵受益）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:287
#: 5e07042b55ab41b08644946d44952925
msgid "**MDD × Fence** —— LLM 调用加会话成本上限 （过线拒新调用）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:290
#: 30164123c7a74104b7a173d81733a775
msgid "三条都是\"单兵 Day 1 就能上\"的格。 团队通常从 SDD × Bridle 起步；单兵通常从 TDD × Fence 起步。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:295
#: 7f0028cdb597401dbee9703136f9bd54
msgid "Slide 21 —— §F.7 · 三个要提防的陷阱"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:297
#: 466f0480d1ee40d980a2615c0e2b68da
msgid "**\"Day 30 搞定了\"陷阱** —— 无 Groom，90 天后分数回落"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:298
#: 2f5874a202b64fd6969fcef213086408
msgid "**\"Groom 以后再说\"陷阱** —— 一开始就不放 Groom = 装饰"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:299
#: a9e2625765a0435bbfaff9579a2d33ef
msgid "**\"凑齐了再发布\"陷阱** —— 等 12 格 ≥ 3 再上线 = 永远不上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:301
#: f80d650c80184c6b90fc80f8b20abba7
msgid "这张是 §F.7 的收口。念完三条再放 Slide 22。 强调中间那条 —— *\"没有 Groom 的挽具，不是挽具，是装饰。\"*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:306
#: ec252e57cb064a4293b94c3b6aa4ce28
msgid "Slide 22 —— §F.8 · 三句要被记住的话"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:308
#: 998e1fdc8e4b4caf8f801c35e19473d0
msgid "Harness Engineering 不是加一层流程，是 **提取会机械拒绝坏工作的那一小撮制品**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:309
#: f7d5942d8a2a4f5d8f6547e70d5f2a6a
msgid "**SDD → TDD → MDD**，顺序不能乱"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:310
#: 4edafe88de924268b1cf7310ea3ceca7
msgid "不做 12 格 —— **挑 1 格，30 天上线，90 天公开 HarnessCard**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:312
#: fa0c7ebdaffa4534a4137a4bce2e361c
msgid "**逐字念**。这是全场信号量最高的一张 slide。 念完后停 3 秒，再开 Q&A mic。"
msgstr ""

