#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:331
#: bff3f6c80a774fc8a262bfd157c29f12
msgid "Q：**三个护法一定要全上吗？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:332
#: c219fe7e6dc34c13b87ed392313833ed
msgid "A：不用。Day 30 一格就算进展"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:333
#: 0beed9263dcc4ec6a5b06db3260b8126
msgid "Q：**这不就是 DevOps 重新包装？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/slides.md:334
#: 86fa873f142a43dc9b0ed259d7faa36e
msgid "A：不是。**commit 前 = harness；commit 后 = DevOps**"
msgstr ""

